<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:xr="using:ExpressiveAvalonia.Controls"
                    xmlns:theming="using:ExpressiveAvalonia.Theming">
  <!-- XR family (source: XR app bar, dialog, toolbar, navigation rail/bar, and the
       surface / surface-high / tertiary-container button building blocks).

       Geometry follows the source design.json values in device-independent units except the
       floating toolbar, which follows the pinned XR tokens:
       app bar 72 high with a 36 radius; dialog 312 wide with a 28 radius; toolbar pill
       64 high with a 32 radius and 8 padding; rail 96 wide with a 48 radius, 20 vertical
       padding and a 20 destination gap; navigation bar 80 high with a 40 radius and 8
       horizontal padding; icon button 48 hit target with a 40 circular container; labeled
       toggle 40 high with 16,10 padding; FAB 56 with a 16 radius.

       Pinned-source reconciliation (xr/compose/material3 @ 77b2199d):
       - NavigationBar.kt SpatialNavigationBar: 80 min height, 8 horizontal padding,
         50% container shape -> this nav bar matches (80 high, 8 padding, 40/80 radius).
       - ShortNavigationBar.kt SpatialShortNavigationBar: same 80 container with 32 padding
         around and between items (XrShortNavigationBarTokens.PaddingAroundItems); the
         XrNavigationBar short variant applies those values. It has no local design package,
         so only the pinned token values drive it.
       - NavigationRail.kt SpatialNavigationRail: 96 min width, 20 vertical padding,
         circular Surface, destinations spaced by 20 -> this rail matches (96 wide, 48 radius,
         0,20 padding, 20 destination gap).
       - SpatialWideNavigationRail: same 96 collapsed width, circular Surface, 20 vertical
         padding and 20 destination gap; expanded width is 220..360 from the source wide rail,
         with its caller-supplied header slot -> XrNavigationRail's wide variant applies those
         values and exposes Variant/IsExpanded/Header/ExpandedWidth. The Orbiter and spatial
         elevation stay absent.
       - FloatingToolbar.kt Spatial*FloatingToolbar: 64 min cross-size, 50% shape, 8 padding,
         8 toolbar-to-FAB gap -> this toolbar follows the pinned tokens and reuses the common
         MaterialFloatingToolbarLayout: expanded leading/trailing slots and the common
         exit-always scroll behavior are wired; only the Orbiter/spatial elevation stay absent.
       - AppBar.kt wraps the common TopAppBar in a 50% Orbiter; 72 high / 36 radius here is
         that 50% shape at 72, without the Orbiter.
       - SpaceToggleButton.kt, ThreePaneScaffold.kt and ListDetailPaneScaffold.kt have no
         desktop port here: they need spatial capabilities or belong to the common
         navigation/scaffold families.
       Orbiters, 24 dp spatial offsets, elevation and space/full-space mode are deliberately
       absent; this is a desktop composition, not a spatial runtime.

       Color roles, verified against the source variants: a selected container uses
       secondary-container on "surface", secondary-fixed-dim on "surface high", and
       tertiary-fixed-dim on "tertiary container"; the selected content uses
       on-secondary-fixed-variant, on-secondary-fixed, and on-tertiary-fixed respectively.
       Navigation destinations reuse the secondary-container selection with the
       on-secondary-fixed-variant icon and the on-surface label. The tertiary toolbar swaps
       its FAB to primary/on-primary. All roles stay dynamic under MaterialTheme's
       seed/contrast changes.

       Interaction: icon buttons keep a transparent container and paint only the shared
       MaterialRipple state layer and press ripple (0.08 hover, 0.10 focus, 0.10 press, from
       md.sys.state) plus the 8 unit pressed shape. Labeled toggles additionally show a
       surface-container pill on hover, focus, and press while unselected, matching the
       source building block. Navigation destinations draw the ripple inside their indicator
       pill, as the source does. Disabled states use
       the pinned per-component alphas: StandardIconButtonTokens OnSurface 0.38,
       FilledTonalIconButtonTokens OnSurface 0.1 container / 0.38 content,
       FilledTonalButtonTokens OnSurface 0.12 container / 0.38 label,
       TextButtonTokens OnSurfaceVariant 0.38, and NavigationBar/Rail inactive colors at
       0.38. There are no shared composite disabled brushes in this dictionary.

       Transitions bind to the md.sys.motion duration tokens, so MaterialTheme's Reduced
       mode (which zeroes them) removes the shape animation without any extra code here;
       MaterialRipple reads the same reduced-motion state for its state layer and presses. -->

  <!-- FAB anatomy only: the containing rail or toolbar supplies the fill and icon role, so
       a parent style never has to fight this theme for Background or Foreground. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="XrFabTheme" TargetType="Button">
    <Setter Property="Width" Value="56" />
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="56" />
    <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="56" />
    <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="56" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="16" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="16" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel Background="Transparent">
          <Border Name="Surface" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                  CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}" />
          <!-- Interaction is the shared MaterialRipple: source RippleNode state layer and the
               bounded press ripple, with no second pressed alpha. -->
          <theming:MaterialRipple Name="Ripple"
                                  Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                                  CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                                  PressOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialPressedStateLayerOpacity}"
                                  HoverOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialHoverStateLayerOpacity}"
                                  FocusOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialFocusStateLayerOpacity}"
                                  EnableDrag="False"
                                  IsHitTestVisible="False" />
          <ContentPresenter Name="PART_Content" Content="{TemplateBinding Content}" ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}"
                            Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                            HorizontalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                            VerticalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}"
                            RecognizesAccessKey="True" />
          <Border Name="FocusRing" Margin="-2" CornerRadius="18"
                  BorderBrush="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryBrush}" BorderThickness="3"
                  IsVisible="False" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#Surface">
      <Setter Property="Transitions">
        <Transitions>
          <BrushTransition Property="Background" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
        </Transitions>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:focus-visible /template/ Border#FocusRing">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled">
      <!-- FABs have no upstream disabled token set. The enclosing rail/toolbar owns the FAB
           tone, so disabled paints the on-surface container at the 0.1 disabled-container alpha
           and the content at 0.38, the same alphas FilledTonalIconButtonTokens uses. -->
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ Border#Surface">
      <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.1" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_Content">
      <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.38" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- Dialog action: a native text button with the 40 unit action height. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="XrDialogActionTheme" TargetType="Button">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialPrimaryBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="40" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="16,10" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="9999" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialFontFamily}" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialLabelLargeFontSize}" />
    <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialLabelLargeFontWeight}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel Background="Transparent">
          <Border Name="Surface" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                  CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}" />
          <theming:MaterialRipple Name="Ripple"
                                  Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                                  CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                                  PressOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialPressedStateLayerOpacity}"
                                  HoverOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialHoverStateLayerOpacity}"
                                  FocusOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialFocusStateLayerOpacity}"
                                  EnableDrag="False"
                                  IsHitTestVisible="False" />
          <ContentPresenter Content="{TemplateBinding Content}" ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}"
                            Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                            HorizontalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                            VerticalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}"
                            LineHeight="{DynamicResource MaterialLabelLargeLineHeight}"
                            RecognizesAccessKey="True" />
          <Border Name="FocusRing" Margin="-2" CornerRadius="9999"
                  BorderBrush="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryBrush}" BorderThickness="3"
                  IsVisible="False" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Style Selector="^:focus-visible /template/ Border#FocusRing">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled">
      <!-- TextButtonTokens: DisabledIcon/LabelColor OnSurfaceVariant at 0.38. -->
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceVariantBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.38" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- Icon button: 48 hit target, 40 container, 20 icon. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type xr:XrIconButton}" TargetType="xr:XrIconButton">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceVariantBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="9999" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="48" />
    <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="48" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel Background="Transparent">
          <Border Name="Container" Width="40" Height="40"
                  Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                  CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                  HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
          <!-- The shared MaterialRipple lives in the 40 DIP container, not the 48 DIP hit target,
               so hover/focus/press keep the source icon-button geometry. -->
          <theming:MaterialRipple Name="Ripple" Width="40" Height="40"
                                  Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                                  CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                                  PressOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialPressedStateLayerOpacity}"
                                  HoverOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialHoverStateLayerOpacity}"
                                  FocusOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialFocusStateLayerOpacity}"
                                  EnableDrag="False"
                                  HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                  IsHitTestVisible="False" />
          <Path Name="Icon" Data="{TemplateBinding Icon}" Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                Width="20" Height="20" Stretch="Uniform"
                HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
          <Border Name="FocusRing" Margin="2" CornerRadius="9999"
                  BorderBrush="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryBrush}" BorderThickness="3"
                  IsVisible="False" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#Container">
      <Setter Property="Transitions">
        <Transitions>
          <CornerRadiusTransition Property="CornerRadius" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
          <BrushTransition Property="Background" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
        </Transitions>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^ /template/ theming|MaterialRipple#Ripple">
      <Setter Property="Transitions">
        <Transitions>
          <CornerRadiusTransition Property="CornerRadius" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
        </Transitions>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:tertiary-container">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnTertiaryFixedVariantBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:pressed">
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="8" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:focus-visible /template/ Border#FocusRing">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled">
      <!-- StandardIconButtonTokens: DisabledColor OnSurface at DisabledOpacity 0.38. -->
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.38" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- Toggleable icon button: the selected container is the surface's emphasized role. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type xr:XrToggleIconButton}" TargetType="xr:XrToggleIconButton">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceVariantBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="9999" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="48" />
    <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="48" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel Background="Transparent">
          <Border Name="Container" Width="40" Height="40"
                  Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                  CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                  HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
          <!-- The shared MaterialRipple lives in the 40 DIP container, not the 48 DIP hit target,
               so hover/focus/press keep the source icon-button geometry. -->
          <theming:MaterialRipple Name="Ripple" Width="40" Height="40"
                                  Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                                  CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                                  PressOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialPressedStateLayerOpacity}"
                                  HoverOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialHoverStateLayerOpacity}"
                                  FocusOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialFocusStateLayerOpacity}"
                                  EnableDrag="False"
                                  HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                  IsHitTestVisible="False" />
          <Path Name="Icon" Data="{TemplateBinding Icon}" Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                Width="20" Height="20" Stretch="Uniform"
                HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
          <Path Name="SelectedIcon" Data="{TemplateBinding EffectiveSelectedIcon}" Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                Width="20" Height="20" Stretch="Uniform" IsVisible="False"
                HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
          <Border Name="FocusRing" Margin="2" CornerRadius="9999"
                  BorderBrush="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryBrush}" BorderThickness="3"
                  IsVisible="False" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#Container">
      <Setter Property="Transitions">
        <Transitions>
          <CornerRadiusTransition Property="CornerRadius" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
          <BrushTransition Property="Background" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
        </Transitions>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^ /template/ theming|MaterialRipple#Ripple">
      <Setter Property="Transitions">
        <Transitions>
          <CornerRadiusTransition Property="CornerRadius" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
        </Transitions>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:tertiary-container">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnTertiaryFixedVariantBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:checked">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryContainerBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSecondaryFixedVariantBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:surface-high:checked">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryFixedDimBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSecondaryFixedBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:tertiary-container:checked">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialTertiaryFixedDimBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnTertiaryFixedBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:checked /template/ Path#Icon">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:checked /template/ Path#SelectedIcon">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:pressed">
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="8" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:focus-visible /template/ Border#FocusRing">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled">
      <!-- FilledTonalIconButtonTokens: DisabledContainerColor OnSurface at 0.1, content at 0.38. -->
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ Border#Container">
      <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.1" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ Path">
      <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.38" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- Labeled toggle: 40 unit pill, 8 unit icon/label gap, 16,10 padding. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type xr:XrToggleButton}" TargetType="xr:XrToggleButton">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceVariantBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="9999" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="48" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialFontFamily}" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel Background="Transparent">
          <Grid HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
            <Border Name="Container" Height="40" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                    CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}" />
            <!-- Shared MaterialRipple over the 40 DIP pill; it stretches to the label width like the
                 container it covers. -->
            <theming:MaterialRipple Name="Ripple" Height="40"
                                    Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                                    CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                                    PressOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialPressedStateLayerOpacity}"
                                    HoverOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialHoverStateLayerOpacity}"
                                    FocusOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialFocusStateLayerOpacity}"
                                    EnableDrag="False"
                                    IsHitTestVisible="False" />
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8" Margin="16,10"
                        HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
              <Path Name="Icon" Data="{TemplateBinding Icon}" Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                    Width="18" Height="18" Stretch="Uniform" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
              <Path Name="SelectedIcon" Data="{TemplateBinding EffectiveSelectedIcon}" Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                    Width="18" Height="18" Stretch="Uniform" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                    IsVisible="False" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
              <TextBlock Name="Label" Text="{TemplateBinding Label}"
                         Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                         FontSize="{DynamicResource MaterialLabelLargeFontSize}"
                         FontWeight="{DynamicResource MaterialLabelLargeFontWeight}"
                         LineHeight="{DynamicResource MaterialLabelLargeLineHeight}"
                         VerticalAlignment="Center" />
            </StackPanel>
          </Grid>
          <Border Name="FocusRing" Margin="2" CornerRadius="9999"
                  BorderBrush="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryBrush}" BorderThickness="3"
                  IsVisible="False" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#Container">
      <Setter Property="Transitions">
        <Transitions>
          <CornerRadiusTransition Property="CornerRadius" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
          <BrushTransition Property="Background" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
        </Transitions>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^ /template/ theming|MaterialRipple#Ripple">
      <Setter Property="Transitions">
        <Transitions>
          <CornerRadiusTransition Property="CornerRadius" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
        </Transitions>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:not(:checked):pointerover">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSurfaceContainerBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:not(:checked):focus-visible">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSurfaceContainerBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:tertiary-container">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnTertiaryFixedVariantBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:checked">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryContainerBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSecondaryFixedVariantBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:surface-high:checked">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryFixedDimBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSecondaryFixedBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:tertiary-container:checked">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialTertiaryFixedDimBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnTertiaryFixedBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:checked /template/ Path#Icon">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:checked /template/ Path#SelectedIcon">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:no-icon /template/ Path#Icon, ^:no-icon /template/ Path#SelectedIcon">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:pressed">
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="8" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:focus-visible /template/ Border#FocusRing">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled">
      <!-- FilledTonalButtonTokens: DisabledContainerColor OnSurface at 0.12,
           DisabledLabelTextColor OnSurface at 0.38. -->
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ Border#Container">
      <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.12" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ Path">
      <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.38" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ TextBlock#Label">
      <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.38" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- Navigation bar destination: 112 wide, 80 high, 64x32 icon container, 12 unit label. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type xr:XrNavigationBarItem}" TargetType="xr:XrNavigationBarItem">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceVariantBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="112" />
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="80" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel Background="Transparent" ClipToBounds="False">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Vertical" Spacing="4" Margin="0,12,0,0"
                      HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Top">
            <Grid Width="64" Height="32">
              <Border Name="IconContainer" CornerRadius="9999" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" />
              <!-- Shared MaterialRipple confined to the 64x32 pill, matching the source indicator. -->
              <theming:MaterialRipple Name="Ripple"
                                      Fill="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceVariantBrush}"
                                      CornerRadius="9999"
                                      PressOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialPressedStateLayerOpacity}"
                                      HoverOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialHoverStateLayerOpacity}"
                                      FocusOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialFocusStateLayerOpacity}"
                                      EnableDrag="False"
                                      IsHitTestVisible="False" />
              <Grid Width="24" Height="24" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Path Name="Icon" Data="{TemplateBinding Icon}"
                      Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                      Width="24" Height="24" Stretch="Uniform" />
                <Path Name="SelectedIcon" Data="{TemplateBinding EffectiveSelectedIcon}"
                      Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                      Width="24" Height="24" Stretch="Uniform" IsVisible="False" />
                <Border Name="BadgeLarge" MinWidth="16" Height="16" CornerRadius="8" Padding="4,0"
                        Background="{DynamicResource MaterialErrorBrush}"
                        HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,-2,-4,0"
                        IsVisible="False">
                  <TextBlock Text="{TemplateBinding BadgeText}" FontSize="11" LineHeight="16"
                             Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialOnErrorBrush}"
                             HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                </Border>
                <Border Name="BadgeSmall" Width="6" Height="6" CornerRadius="3"
                        Background="{DynamicResource MaterialErrorBrush}"
                        HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,-4,0"
                        IsVisible="False" />
              </Grid>
            </Grid>
            <TextBlock Name="Label" Text="{TemplateBinding Label}"
                       Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                       FontSize="12" LineHeight="16" FontWeight="Medium"
                       HorizontalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" MaxWidth="104" />
          </StackPanel>
          <Border Name="FocusRing" Margin="3" CornerRadius="12"
                  BorderBrush="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryBrush}" BorderThickness="3"
                  IsVisible="False" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#IconContainer">
      <Setter Property="Transitions">
        <Transitions>
          <BrushTransition Property="Background" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
        </Transitions>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryContainerBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected /template/ Path#Icon, ^:selected /template/ Path#SelectedIcon">
      <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSecondaryFixedVariantBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected /template/ theming|MaterialRipple#Ripple">
      <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSecondaryFixedVariantBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected /template/ TextBlock#Label">
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected /template/ Path#Icon">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected /template/ Path#SelectedIcon">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:focus-visible /template/ Border#FocusRing">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:badge-large /template/ Border#BadgeLarge">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:badge-small /template/ Border#BadgeSmall">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:no-label /template/ TextBlock#Label">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled">
      <!-- NavigationBarTokens: inactive icon and label OnSurfaceVariant, disabled alpha 0.38.
           The selected indicator container stays painted, as in the source. -->
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceVariantBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ Path, ^:disabled /template/ TextBlock#Label">
      <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.38" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- Navigation rail destination: 56x32 pill growing to 56 wide, or a 56x56 square
       when the label is hidden, as in the source rail. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type xr:XrNavigationRailItem}" TargetType="xr:XrNavigationRailItem">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceVariantBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="96" />
    <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="56" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel Background="Transparent" ClipToBounds="False">
          <StackPanel Name="Content" Orientation="Vertical" Spacing="4" Margin="0,2"
                      HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
            <Border Name="IconContainer" Width="24" Height="32" CornerRadius="9999"
                    Background="{TemplateBinding Background}">
              <Grid>
                <!-- Shared MaterialRipple confined to the source icon indicator pill. -->
                <theming:MaterialRipple Name="Ripple"
                                        Fill="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceVariantBrush}"
                                        CornerRadius="9999"
                                        PressOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialPressedStateLayerOpacity}"
                                        HoverOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialHoverStateLayerOpacity}"
                                        FocusOpacity="{DynamicResource MaterialFocusStateLayerOpacity}"
                                        EnableDrag="False"
                                        IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                <Grid Width="24" Height="24" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                  <Path Name="Icon" Data="{TemplateBinding Icon}"
                        Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                        Width="24" Height="24" Stretch="Uniform" />
                  <Path Name="SelectedIcon" Data="{TemplateBinding EffectiveSelectedIcon}"
                        Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                        Width="24" Height="24" Stretch="Uniform" IsVisible="False" />
                  <Border Name="BadgeLarge" MinWidth="16" Height="16" CornerRadius="8" Padding="4,0"
                          Background="{DynamicResource MaterialErrorBrush}"
                          HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,-2,-4,0"
                          IsVisible="False">
                    <TextBlock Text="{TemplateBinding BadgeText}" FontSize="11" LineHeight="16"
                               Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialOnErrorBrush}"
                               HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                  </Border>
                  <Border Name="BadgeSmall" Width="6" Height="6" CornerRadius="3"
                          Background="{DynamicResource MaterialErrorBrush}"
                          HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,-4,0"
                          IsVisible="False" />
                </Grid>
              </Grid>
            </Border>
            <TextBlock Name="Label" Text="{TemplateBinding Label}"
                       Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                       FontSize="12" LineHeight="16" FontWeight="Medium"
                       IsVisible="{TemplateBinding ShowLabel}"
                       HorizontalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" MaxWidth="88" />
          </StackPanel>
          <Border Name="FocusRing" Margin="3" CornerRadius="12"
                  BorderBrush="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryBrush}" BorderThickness="3"
                  IsVisible="False" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#IconContainer">
      <Setter Property="Transitions">
        <Transitions>
          <DoubleTransition Property="Width" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
          <DoubleTransition Property="Height" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
          <BrushTransition Property="Background" Duration="{DynamicResource MaterialDurationShort4}" Easing="0.2,0,0,1" />
        </Transitions>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryContainerBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected /template/ Border#IconContainer">
      <Setter Property="Width" Value="56" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:no-label /template/ StackPanel#Content">
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:no-label /template/ Border#IconContainer">
      <Setter Property="Width" Value="56" />
      <Setter Property="Height" Value="56" />
    </Style>
    <!-- SpatialWideNavigationRail expanded destination: the 20 unit start inset and the icon
         indicator at the start of a horizontal row; the collapsed wide rail keeps this theme's
         standard centered column. -->
    <Style Selector="^:rail-expanded">
      <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="0" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:rail-expanded /template/ StackPanel#Content">
      <Setter Property="Orientation" Value="Horizontal" />
      <Setter Property="Spacing" Value="12" />
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="20,0" />
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:rail-expanded /template/ Border#IconContainer">
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:rail-expanded /template/ TextBlock#Label">
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left" />
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
      <Setter Property="MaxWidth" Value="240" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected /template/ Path#Icon, ^:selected /template/ Path#SelectedIcon">
      <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSecondaryFixedVariantBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected /template/ theming|MaterialRipple#Ripple">
      <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSecondaryFixedVariantBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected /template/ TextBlock#Label">
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected /template/ Path#Icon">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:selected /template/ Path#SelectedIcon">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:focus-visible /template/ Border#FocusRing">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:badge-large /template/ Border#BadgeLarge">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:badge-small /template/ Border#BadgeSmall">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled">
      <!-- NavigationRailColorTokens: inactive icon and label OnSurfaceVariant at 0.38. -->
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceVariantBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ Path, ^:disabled /template/ TextBlock#Label">
      <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.38" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- Navigation bar container: 80 high, 40 radius, 8 horizontal padding. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type xr:XrNavigationBar}" TargetType="xr:XrNavigationBar">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSurfaceContainerBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="8,0" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Border Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" CornerRadius="40" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}">
          <ItemsPresenter Name="PART_ItemsPresenter" ItemsPanel="{TemplateBinding ItemsPanel}" />
        </Border>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <!-- SpatialShortNavigationBar: 32 horizontal padding from XrShortNavigationBarTokens; the
         control's item panel supplies the matching 32 gap. The container height and 50% shape are
         shared with the standard bar. -->
    <Style Selector="^:short">
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="32,0" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- Standard navigation rail: 96 wide, 48 radius, 20 vertical padding, menu then FAB.
       SpatialWideNavigationRail uses a separate header above a circular item surface, 20 gap,
       96 collapsed and 220–360 expanded width; standard rail chrome is not injected into it. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type xr:XrNavigationRail}" TargetType="xr:XrNavigationRail">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSurfaceContainerBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="96" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Border Name="PART_Surface" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                CornerRadius="48" Padding="0,20" MinWidth="96"
                Width="{TemplateBinding RailWidth}">
          <StackPanel Name="PART_RootStack" Orientation="Vertical" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
            <StackPanel Name="PART_Chrome" Orientation="Vertical" Spacing="4" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
              <xr:XrIconButton Name="PART_Menu"
                               Icon="{TemplateBinding MenuIcon}"
                               Label="{TemplateBinding MenuLabel}"
                               Command="{TemplateBinding MenuCommand}"
                               CommandParameter="{TemplateBinding MenuCommandParameter}"
                               IsVisible="{TemplateBinding ShowMenu}" />
              <Button Name="PART_Fab" Theme="{StaticResource XrFabTheme}"
                      Background="{DynamicResource MaterialTertiaryContainerBrush}"
                      Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialOnTertiaryFixedVariantBrush}"
                      IsVisible="{TemplateBinding ShowFab}"
                      Command="{TemplateBinding FabCommand}"
                      CommandParameter="{TemplateBinding FabCommandParameter}"
                      AutomationProperties.Name="{Binding FabLabel, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                <Path Data="{TemplateBinding FabIcon}" Fill="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=Button}}"
                      Width="24" Height="24" Stretch="Uniform" />
              </Button>
            </StackPanel>
            <Border Name="GroupGap" Height="40" />
            <ItemsPresenter Name="PART_ItemsPresenter" ItemsPanel="{TemplateBinding ItemsPanel}" />
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Style Selector="^:wide">
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <ControlTemplate>
          <StackPanel Spacing="20" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
            <ContentPresenter Name="PART_Header" Content="{TemplateBinding Header}"
                              ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding HeaderTemplate}"
                              HorizontalAlignment="Center" IsVisible="False" />
            <Border Name="PART_Surface" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                    CornerRadius="9999" Padding="0,20" Width="{TemplateBinding RailWidth}">
              <StackPanel Name="PART_RootStack" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
                <ItemsPresenter Name="PART_ItemsPresenter" ItemsPanel="{TemplateBinding ItemsPanel}" />
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>
          </StackPanel>
        </ControlTemplate>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:no-fab /template/ Border#GroupGap">
      <Setter Property="Height" Value="20" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:wide:has-header /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_Header">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:wide:expanded /template/ StackPanel#PART_RootStack">
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- Toolbar: pinned XrFloatingToolbar geometry - 64 min cross-size, 50% shape, 8 content
       padding, 8 toolbar-to-FAB gap. The common MaterialFloatingToolbarLayout supplies the
       expanded leading/trailing slots and the FAB 80/56 animation; MaterialAppBarScrollBehavior
       (floating exit-always) supplies hide/show. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type xr:XrToolbar}" TargetType="xr:XrToolbar">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSurfaceContainerBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="64" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <xr:MaterialFloatingToolbarLayout Name="PART_Layout"
                                          ExpandedProgress="{TemplateBinding ExpandedProgress}"
                                          Orientation="{TemplateBinding Orientation}"
                                          FabPosition="{TemplateBinding EffectiveFabPosition}"
                                          ShowFab="{TemplateBinding ShowFab}">
          <Border Name="PART_Background" ClipToBounds="True"
                  Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" CornerRadius="32" />
          <Border Name="PART_Leading" ClipToBounds="True">
            <ContentPresenter Content="{TemplateBinding LeadingContent}"
                              VerticalAlignment="Center" HorizontalAlignment="Center" />
          </Border>
          <Border Name="PART_Content" ClipToBounds="True"
                  Padding="{TemplateBinding ContentPadding}">
            <ItemsPresenter Name="PART_ItemsPresenter" ItemsPanel="{TemplateBinding ItemsPanel}" />
          </Border>
          <Border Name="PART_Trailing" ClipToBounds="True">
            <ContentPresenter Content="{TemplateBinding TrailingContent}"
                              VerticalAlignment="Center" HorizontalAlignment="Center" />
          </Border>
          <Button Name="PART_Fab" Theme="{StaticResource XrFabTheme}"
                  HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" VerticalAlignment="Stretch"
                  Command="{TemplateBinding FabCommand}"
                  CommandParameter="{TemplateBinding FabCommandParameter}"
                  IsVisible="{TemplateBinding ShowFab}"
                  AutomationProperties.Name="{Binding FabLabel, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
            <Path Data="{TemplateBinding FabIcon}" Fill="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=Button}}"
                  Width="24" Height="24" Stretch="Uniform" />
          </Button>
        </xr:MaterialFloatingToolbarLayout>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Style Selector="^:vertical">
      <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="64" />
    </Style>
    <!-- The FAB follows the toolbar tone: tertiary container on surface tones, primary on
         the tertiary toolbar. The FAB theme carries no colors, so these setters are final. -->
    <Style Selector="^ /template/ Button#PART_Fab">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialTertiaryContainerBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnTertiaryContainerBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:elevation-high">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSurfaceContainerHighBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:elevation-highest">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSurfaceContainerHighestBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:tertiary-container">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialTertiaryContainerBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:tertiary-container /template/ Button#PART_Fab">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialPrimaryBrush}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnPrimaryBrush}" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- App bar: 72 high, 36 radius, 12 padding, centered or small headline. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type xr:XrAppBar}" TargetType="xr:XrAppBar">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSurfaceContainerBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="72" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="12" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialFontFamily}" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Border Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" CornerRadius="36" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}">
          <Panel>
            <!-- The centered configuration centers the headline in the whole bar, not in the
                 middle column between unequal side slots, so it is a separate overlay. -->
            <TextBlock Name="HeadlineCenter"
                       Text="{TemplateBinding Headline}"
                       Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                       FontSize="{DynamicResource MaterialTitleLargeFontSize}"
                       LineHeight="{DynamicResource MaterialTitleLargeLineHeight}"
                       FontWeight="{DynamicResource MaterialTitleLargeFontWeight}"
                       Margin="48,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                       TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                       AutomationProperties.HeadingLevel="1" />
            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*,Auto" VerticalAlignment="Center">
              <ContentPresenter Name="PART_Leading" Grid.Column="0"
                                Content="{TemplateBinding LeadingContent}"
                                VerticalAlignment="Center" />
              <TextBlock Name="HeadlineStart" Grid.Column="1" IsVisible="False"
                         Text="{TemplateBinding Headline}"
                         Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                         FontSize="{DynamicResource MaterialTitleLargeFontSize}"
                         LineHeight="{DynamicResource MaterialTitleLargeLineHeight}"
                         FontWeight="{DynamicResource MaterialTitleLargeFontWeight}"
                         Margin="6,0,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                         TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                         AutomationProperties.HeadingLevel="1" />
              <ContentPresenter Name="PART_Trailing" Grid.Column="2"
                                Content="{TemplateBinding TrailingContent}"
                                HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
            </Grid>
          </Panel>
        </Border>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Style Selector="^:small /template/ TextBlock#HeadlineCenter">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:small /template/ TextBlock#HeadlineStart">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:elevation-high">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSurfaceContainerHighBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:elevation-highest">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSurfaceContainerHighestBrush}" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- Dialog: a 312 minimum card with 28 radius, 24 content padding, and a 1 unit divider.
       The window is borderless and transparent, so the template keeps the window parts that
       Avalonia expects (transparency fallback, visual layer manager, content presenter) and
       centres the card inside them. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type xr:XrDialog}" TargetType="xr:XrDialog">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialFontFamily}" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialBodyMediumFontSize}" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel>
          <Border Name="PART_TransparencyFallback" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
          <VisualLayerManager Name="PART_VisualLayerManager">
            <Panel Background="{TemplateBinding Background}">
              <Border Name="Card" MinWidth="312" MaxWidth="560" Margin="16" CornerRadius="28"
                      HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                      Background="{DynamicResource MaterialSurfaceContainerHighBrush}"
                      BoxShadow="{DynamicResource MaterialElevationLevel3Shadow}">
                <StackPanel>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Vertical" Spacing="16" Margin="24,24,24,0">
                    <Border Name="IconRow" IsVisible="False">
                      <Path Name="DialogIcon" Data="{TemplateBinding ContentIcon}"
                            Fill="{DynamicResource MaterialSecondaryBrush}"
                            Width="24" Height="24" Stretch="Uniform"
                            HorizontalAlignment="Center" />
                    </Border>
                    <TextBlock Text="{TemplateBinding Headline}"
                               Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                               FontSize="{DynamicResource MaterialHeadlineSmallFontSize}"
                               LineHeight="{DynamicResource MaterialHeadlineSmallLineHeight}"
                               FontWeight="{DynamicResource MaterialHeadlineSmallFontWeight}"
                               TextWrapping="Wrap"
                               AutomationProperties.HeadingLevel="1" />
                    <TextBlock Text="{TemplateBinding SupportingText}"
                               Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialOnSurfaceVariantBrush}"
                               FontSize="{DynamicResource MaterialBodyMediumFontSize}"
                               LineHeight="{DynamicResource MaterialBodyMediumLineHeight}"
                               TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                    <ContentPresenter Name="PART_ContentPresenter"
                                      Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                                      ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}"
                                      IsVisible="{Binding Content, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}, Converter={x:Static ObjectConverters.IsNotNull}}" />
                  </StackPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="{DynamicResource MaterialOutlineVariantBrush}"
                          IsVisible="{TemplateBinding ShowDivider}" />
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Spacing="8" Margin="24,24,24,8">
                    <Button Name="PART_Secondary" Theme="{StaticResource XrDialogActionTheme}"
                            Content="{TemplateBinding SecondaryActionText}"
                            Command="{TemplateBinding SecondaryCommand}"
                            CommandParameter="{TemplateBinding SecondaryCommandParameter}"
                            IsVisible="{TemplateBinding ShowSecondaryAction}" />
                    <Button Name="PART_Primary" Theme="{StaticResource XrDialogActionTheme}"
                            Content="{TemplateBinding PrimaryActionText}"
                            Command="{TemplateBinding PrimaryCommand}"
                            CommandParameter="{TemplateBinding PrimaryCommandParameter}"
                            IsDefault="True" />
                  </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
            </Panel>
          </VisualLayerManager>
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Style Selector="^:elevation-highest /template/ Border#Card">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource MaterialSurfaceContainerHighestBrush}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:with-icon /template/ Border#IconRow">
      <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>
</ResourceDictionary>
